flowchart TB
    A[Commitment Request] --> B{Required Proof Available?}
    B -- Yes --> C[Commit]
    B -- No --> D{Can proof arrive soon?}
    D -- Yes --> E[Pending State]
    D -- No --> F{Risk Acceptable?}
    F -- Yes --> G[Degraded Safe Default]
    F -- No --> H[Refuse or Escalate]

    C --> I[Replay Record]
    E --> I
    G --> I
    H --> I
